<title>USA: Western Kentucky Univ, won by Nike Securities.</title>
<headline>Western Kentucky Univ, won by Nike Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities LP said it won $6.625 million of Western Kentucky University, consolidated educational building refunding revenue bonds, series M, with a net interest cost of 4.99 percent.</p>
</text>
